On Monday, August 5, 2013 6:45:24 PM UTC-4, Kevin wrote:
> Does Stan support jagged arrays?

No

> If not, are there any suggestions for a workaround?

Not really any good ones. If you only have a small number of sequences, then you can declare each separately. Perhaps the closest thing to what you are looking for is like you suggested here

> I could simply input a matrix (such as below), but is there a better alternative?
> 3 1 0
> 2 0 0
> 1 3 4

and pass another integer array indicating how many values in each row of this matrix are non-zero so that you can pull those out.

Ben

