Subject: Re: [stan-users] Re: Jagged Arrays
Message-ID: <9J9MSP27xm4.zngsIEVkHIwJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <9J9MSP27xm4.-eEKWsZbHgcJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <9J9MSP27xm4.PpahAB1teBAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <9J9MSP27xm4.-eEKWsZbHgcJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
