From: u743bbacc59f4b25f at groups.google.com (Ben Goodrich)
Date: Tue, 06 Aug 2013 19:05:43 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] How to fit system of equations with Stan
Message-ID: <e1Uw2t6al8k.oPthP-S33CMJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <e1Uw2t6al8k.cG4j3z1HQYUJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <e1Uw2t6al8k.cKTvqnPMjC8J@stan-users.groups.google.com> <e1Uw2t6al8k.cG4j3z1HQYUJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
