We discussed this a few months ago in the context of enabling slice sampling for discrete random variables.  My idea was to have the program check these dependencies via occasional gradient calculations, and then it would give the right answer for simple problems and maybe approx correct answers where there was branching etc.  But I recall that Bob comvinced me it would not work.
A

